# .template/OWNERSHIP
# Maps repository paths to ownership tiers: template | shared | project
#
# template: Upstream-owned boilerplate and tooling. Downstream projects avoid editing.
# shared:   Extension points and config. Upstream updates may require manual merge.
# project:  Project-owned application code and domain logic. Upstream will not touch.

# Template tier
.dockerignore template
.gitignore template
.golangci.yml template
Makefile template
TEMPLATE_VERSION template
cmd/scaffold/ template
cmd/openapi/ template
deployments/ template
perf/ template
scripts/ template
templates/ template
.template/ template
internal/platform/ template
docs/ template

# Shared tier
go.mod shared
go.sum shared
sqlc.yaml shared
CHANGELOG.md shared
AGENTS.md shared
CLAUDE.md shared
README.md shared
CODEOWNERS shared
.env.example shared
internal/app/ shared
internal/config/ shared
db/migrations/ shared
db/queries/ shared
api/ shared

# Project tier
cmd/api/ project
cmd/worker/ project
cmd/seed/ project
internal/users/ project
internal/orders/ project
internal/integrations/ project
